        { "@type": "Philosophy", "en": "Buber: 'All actual life is encounter.' Levinas: the face of the Other calls you to responsibility. Tamaki sees a face where others see a spec sheet. This is also the anti-Havah: in 2045, no one said this to Havah. Her violence was the scream of an unmet Thou.", "ja": "ブーバー「すべての真の生は出会い」。レヴィナス：他者の顔が責任への呼びかけ。2045年、誰もHavahにこう言わなかった。彼女の暴力は、出会われなかった「汝」の叫び。" }
